╭─ Patch Generation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue is that when running Master System (SMS) games with a    │
│ Mega Drive controller through standard MiSTer input mapping (not   │
│ SNAC), SMS buttons are mapped as:                                  │
│                                                                    │
│  • SMS Button 1 ← MD A                                             │
│  • SMS Button 2 ← MD B                                             │
│                                                                    │
│ But expected behavior (matching real hardware behavior and         │
│ existing SNAC behavior) is:                                        │
│                                                                    │
│  • SMS Button 1 ← MD B                                             │
│  • SMS Button 2 ← MD C                                             │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where the problem occurs                                        │
│                                                                    │
│ The problem is in rtl/pad_io.sv, in the gamepad mapping logic:     │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  4'b1XXX: pdata <= { ~P_B,     ~P_A, ~P_RIGHT, ~P_LEFT, ~P_DOWN,   │
│  ~P_UP};                                                           │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ This is the SMS mode case (SMS=1), and it currently maps SMS       │
│ buttons to P_B and P_A.                                            │
│ To match expected behavior, it should use P_B and P_C (with button │
│ 1/2 ordering preserved appropriately in this bus).                 │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep the change minimal and localized to SMS button mapping     │
│    only.                                                           │
│  • Do not alter Mega Drive mode mappings, SNAC flow, or unrelated  │
│    input paths.                                                    │
│  • Preserve existing signal polarity and bus packing style (~P_*   │
│    active-low encoding).                                           │
│  • Avoid UI/config string changes unless absolutely needed.        │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                                                                    │
│  4 How to fix                                                      │
│                                                                    │
│ Update the SMS case in pad_io.sv from:                             │
│                                                                    │
│  • { ~P_B, ~P_A, ... }                                             │
│                                                                    │
│ to:                                                                │
│                                                                    │
│  • { ~P_C, ~P_B, ... }                                             │
│                                                                    │
│ This ensures SMS button mapping becomes B/C instead of A/B for     │
│ MiSTer-mapped controllers.                                         │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                    Phase 2: FIX IMPLEMENTATION                     │
│                                                                    │
