│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The bug is that CHERIoT Ibex continues to use/allocate instruction │
│ cache while the core is in debug mode.                             │
│ In debug mode, instruction memory may be modified by a debugger,   │
│ so using cached instructions can return stale code and cause       │
│ incorrect execution behavior.                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where it occurs                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue is in rtl/ibex_if_stage.sv, in the ibex_icache           │
│ instantiation.                                                     │
│ Currently, the IF stage passes icache_enable_i directly into the   │
│ cache:                                                             │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  .icache_enable_i     ( icache_enable_i            ),              │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ This means debug mode does not force cache disable.                │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep the fix minimal and localized.                             │
│  • Preserve normal behavior outside debug mode.                    │
│  • Avoid changing interfaces unless necessary.                     │
│  • Explicitly gate cache enable in debug mode (~debug_mode_i) so   │
│    debug fetches are uncached.                                     │
│  • Do not alter test files.                                        │
│                                                                    │
│  4 How to fix                                                      │
│                                                                    │
│ Gate instruction cache enable when wiring the IF stage to the      │
│ icache:                                                            │
│                                                                    │
│  • Change: icache_enable_i                                         │
│  • To: icache_enable_i & ~debug_mode_i                             │
│                                                                    │
│ This ensures caching is disabled whenever debug mode is active,    │
│ matching upstream intent.                                          │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                    Phase 2: FIX IMPLEMENTATION                     │
│                                                                    │
│ ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓ │
│ ┃                         modification 1                         ┃ │
│ ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛ │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  [file]rtl/ibex_if_stage.sv[/file]                                 │
│  [original]        .icache_enable_i     ( icache_enable_i          │
│  ),                                                                │
│          .icache_inval_i      ( icache_inval_i             ),      │
│          .busy_o              ( prefetch_busy                      │
│  )[/original]                                                      │
