│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue is that when the core enters debug mode, CHERIoT Ibex    │
│ still allows the instruction cache to remain enabled. This can     │
│ return stale/cached instructions instead of reflecting the         │
│ expected debug-visible memory state, causing incorrect debug       │
│ behavior (as tracked in lowRISC ibex#1472).                        │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where it occurs                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ In rtl/ibex_if_stage.sv, inside the gen_icache instantiation of    │
│ ibex_icache, the cache enable is currently wired directly:         │
│                                                                    │
│  • .icache_enable_i ( icache_enable_i )                            │
│                                                                    │
│ This does not factor in debug_mode_i, so caching remains active in │
│ debug mode.                                                        │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for fix                                          │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep the change minimal and localized.                          │
│  • Reuse existing control signals (debug_mode_i) rather than       │
│    introducing unnecessary new state.                              │
│  • Preserve normal behavior outside debug mode.                    │
│  • Avoid touching unrelated modules or tests.                      │
│                                                                    │
│  4 How to fix                                                      │
│                                                                    │
│ Gate the I-cache enable with ~debug_mode_i at the ibex_icache      │
│ instantiation, so the cache is effectively disabled while          │
│ debugging:                                                         │
│                                                                    │
│  • icache_enable_i & ~debug_mode_i                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ This mirrors upstream intent: instruction fetch continues, but     │
│ caching is not used in debug mode.                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                    Phase 2: FIX IMPLEMENTATION                     │
│                                                                    │
│ ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓ │
