│                       Phase 1: FIX ANALYSIS                        │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Problem summary                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The instruction cache remains active while the core is in          │
│ debug_mode.                                                        │
│ In debug mode, instruction fetches must not use cached contents    │
│ (to avoid stale/incorrect instruction behavior during debug        │
│ interactions), but current CHERIoT Ibex wiring does not disable    │
│ cache use in this mode.                                            │
│                                                                    │
│  2 Where it occurs                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue is in rtl/ibex_if_stage.sv, in the I-cache instantiation │
│ path:                                                              │
│                                                                    │
│  • debug_mode_i is available as an IF stage input.                 │
│  • But ibex_icache currently receives icache_enable_i directly:    │
│     • .icache_enable_i ( icache_enable_i )                         │
│                                                                    │
│ So debug mode does not affect whether icache is enabled.           │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep change minimal and localized.                              │
│  • Preserve existing behavior outside debug mode.                  │
│  • Avoid changing interfaces unless necessary.                     │
│  • Reuse existing control (debug_mode_i) already available in IF   │
│    stage.                                                          │
│  • Keep non-ICache configuration (gen_prefetch_buffer) clean and   │
│    warning-free.                                                   │
│                                                                    │
│  4 Fix approach                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│ Create an internal I-cache enable signal in ibex_if_stage:         │
│                                                                    │
│  • icache_enable_internal = icache_enable_i & ~debug_mode_i        │
│                                                                    │
│ Then use this internal signal when driving                         │
│ ibex_icache.icache_enable_i.                                       │
│ Also use it in the non-icache tieoff path (unused_icen) so the     │
│ signal is referenced in both parameter configurations.             │
