│                                                                    │
│  • ibex_if_stage receives debug_mode_i                             │
│  • but passes icache_enable_i directly into ibex_icache without    │
│    disabling it in debug mode.                                     │
│                                                                    │
│ Relevant connection:                                               │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  .icache_enable_i     ( icache_enable_i )                          │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep behavior unchanged outside debug mode.                     │
│  • Apply the fix at the integration point (IF stage) to avoid      │
│    broad structural changes.                                       │
│  • Use minimal logic (combinational masking) to reduce risk.       │
│  • Match upstream Ibex behavior: disable I-cache in debug mode.    │
│                                                                    │
│  4 How to fix                                                      │
│                                                                    │
│ Mask cache enable with ~debug_mode_i when wiring IF stage to       │
