│    ~StallW instead of valid.                                       │
│  • Drive rvvi.csr_wb only when writeback is not stalled and value  │
│    changed.                                                        │
│  • Include wfiM in HaltM so tracer correctly marks halt during     │
│    wfi.                                                            │
