│    check.                                                          │
│  • proc_generate_direct_load independently launches toggle_load()  │
│    threads immediately after reset.                                │
│  • No synchronization exists between these two flows.              │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for the fix                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep deterministic checks isolated from random background       │
│    stimulus.                                                       │
│  • Remove seed-dependent races by adding explicit synchronization. │
│  • Prefer minimal behavioral changes: start random direct loads    │
│    only after the deterministic sanity check is complete.          │
