│    write/read assertions pass.                                     │
│  • Make proc_generate_direct_load wait for that event before       │
│    spawning random toggle_load() processes.                        │
│                                                                    │
│ This preserves all random-load behavior during randomized traffic  │
│ phase while ensuring deterministic sanity check is stable.         │
