│    immediately after reset.                                        │
│  • toggle_load() can choose rand_wait = 0, so a load pulse may     │
│    happen immediately and collide with the deterministic check in  │
│    proc_generate_axi_traffic.                                      │
│                                                                    │
│  3 Best practices for fix                                          │
│                                                                    │
│  • Keep deterministic/smoke checks isolated from randomized        │
│    background stimulus.                                            │
│  • Synchronize process start based on a functional milestone       │
│    (transaction completion), not seed-dependent timing.            │
│  • Keep changes minimal and local to avoid altering test intent.   │
