│                                                                    │
│ Delay launching toggle_load() threads until after the first        │
│ AXI-Lite read response handshake (the deterministic known-register │
│ read) completes.                                                   │
│ This guarantees random load activity starts only after the initial │
│ fixed write/read assertions are done.                              │
